# AI Video Enhancer

AI Video Enhancer built with Google Colab + Gradio.

## Features

- AI Video Upscale (2x / 4x)
- AI Denoise
- AI Sharpen
- Frame Interpolation (30 FPS → 60 FPS / 120 FPS)
- Video Preview
- Download Enhanced Video

## Requirements

- Python 3.10+
- FFmpeg
- PyTorch
- Gradio

## Run

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
```

## Models

- Real-ESRGAN
- RIFE

